WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.151
She stole a

00:00:00.963 --> 00:00:02.095
jet in GTA

00:00:01.907 --> 00:00:02.684
6 with her

00:00:02.496 --> 00:00:03.121
brain

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:04.939
Streamer Perrikaryal

00:00:04.751 --> 00:00:05.658
flew off with

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.189
a jet in

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:07.415
GTA 6 using

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:08.630
EEG commands and

00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:09.337
eye tracking

00:00:09.385 --> 00:00:10.304
after ages of

00:00:10.116 --> 00:00:10.929
practice

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:11.929
The clip looks

00:00:11.741 --> 00:00:12.861
like mind reading

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.545
The real story

00:00:14.357 --> 00:00:15.288
