00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:16.370
The headset does

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.219
not read thoughts

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.174
it reads brain

00:00:17.986 --> 00:00:18.882
signals and eye

00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:19.861
movements and the

00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:20.556
clip does not

00:00:20.368 --> 00:00:21.323
show the practice

00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:21.936
behind it

00:00:22.454 --> 00:00:23.633
The article asks

00:00:23.445 --> 00:00:24.435
why this matters

00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:25.602
beyond one streamer

00:00:25.732 --> 00:00:26.380
and what the

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.194
clip leaves out

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:27.748
about how the

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.163
headset really works

00:00:29.694 --> 00:00:30.708
Full story on

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:31.415
the dashboard
